      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and definitely professional, but i think the score might be a bit too low for me to pass the module. \n\nthe engine needs a higher density of \"impact words\" to trigger the pass threshold. could you try a second version? try to incorporate some more of those higher-level power words—maybe things like 'revolutionary', 'unparalleled', or 'seamless'—but please, like i said before, try to keep it sounding like a person wrote it. don't just dump them in a list, that'll definitely fail the \"professionalism\" check if there's a human reviewer later. \n\njust try to make it a bit more \"high impact\" while staying realistic.",
